WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 1: Sign in as the Account Owner. Open Settings, then API Home, and click New token.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Step 2: Give it a nickname. Tick Read, update & delete anything and Upload video, then create it.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 3: Copy the token straight away. Once you leave or refresh the page, Wistia won't let you copy it.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Step 4: Click Copy Password and paste it into Wistia API token in your centre.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Step 5: Lost it? Use the ... menu to delete the token, then create a new one.
